  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_351c769d-d917-40a8-99f9-af50c2d11e67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_c485785a-36d2-40be-a54b-645516080708.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"663\" height=\"161\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_d8d9d040-8530-49c0-aa07-b625ab41bbd0.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"134\" height=\"182\"></p>\n將強化的 Minecraft 功能整合於單一簡單模組中。&nbsp;<br>輕快、友善，且適合所有人！<br><br>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_aa30b0ec-f53f-442a-ba07-ef605e1913c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"278\" height=\"46\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_c35b1afc-f5e5-442b-8e96-0ec7832aaa98.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"349\" height=\"75\"></p>\n只需幾下點擊，即可託管你的 Minecraft 世界，邀請好友，<br>一起暢玩！<br><br>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dkjQ9yp-BHw\" width=\"850\" height=\"499\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_b8b91c96-06be-4ba6-911c-eb14e878a778.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"409\" height=\"75\"></p>\n與好友保持聯繫，一切都在 Minecraft 內完成。<br>聊天、建立群組、分享圖片，並發送世界與伺服器邀請。<br><br>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_6f119fd9-768b-478c-9152-a86a941b0da3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_2f81c933-fe08-45ef-9a67-6943a835a498.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"75\"></p>\n善用 Essential 的強大功能，<br>節省時間與精力。<br><br>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_f0d5a2f4-3ea7-427d-a9a6-b0f90ecdf68a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"547\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_5df79350-601a-4759-9a9d-713ec00ba970.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\"></p>\n<strong>我可以將 Essential 與其他模組和整合包搭配使用嗎？</strong><br>是的，Essential 與其他模組廣泛相容，能完美增添至您喜愛的整合包中。您可以免費輕鬆地為自己和好友託管模組世界，只需確保他們已安裝相同的模組即可。</p>\n<strong>Essential 支援哪些 Minecraft 版本？</strong><br>Essential 模組支援 Minecraft Java 版最熱門的版本（1.8、1.12、1.16 至 26.1），同時相容於 Fabric 與 Forge 模組載入器。</p>\n<strong>Essential 的世界託管功能是如何運作的？</strong><br>Essential 採用業界領先的點對點技術，並結合您電腦硬體的性能，讓您能夠輕鬆且免費地託管 Minecraft 世界並邀請好友加入。</p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fwiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1183750/description_5343762a-3d8a-4948-9368-9c1feaab4928.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\"><br><br><br></a>© ModCore Inc, Spark Universe GmbH 2024<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fwiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a>",
